# Jarvis AI Voice Assistant

A Python-based AI voice assistant capable of recognizing voice commands and performing tasks like opening websites and speaking responses.

## Features

- Wake word activation ("Jarvis")
- Sleep mode
- Voice command recognition
- Open YouTube, Google, and GitHub
- Text-to-speech responses

## Technologies Used

- Python
- SpeechRecognition
- pyttsx3
- threading

## Project Structure

```bash
project/
│
├── jarvis.py
├── voice_mode.py
├── main.py
└── README.md
```

## Installation

Install required libraries:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

## Run the Assistant

```bash
python voice_mode.py
```

